# What never goes into a build context (and so never into an image layer). See ADR-0081.
# Secrets: .env holds the real keys. They reach a container only as environment variables at start.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/*.env.local
# Everything the build makes again for itself, or that only this machine needs.
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
.claude
graphify-out
logs
docs
observability
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.next
frontend
services/disruption-agent
